        "tracing": "트레이싱"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:31:09.587634Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "perf for network events",
      "source_hash": 8900694989200523421,
      "context_hash": 9064113368648428789,
      "translation": "네트워크 이벤트를 위한 perf",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "perf": "perf"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:38:55.989719Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "bpftrace one-liners",
      "source_hash": 9152515839355150502,
      "context_hash": 199578823334766804,
      "translation": "bpftrace 원라이너",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:38:55.989719Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Wireshark / tcpdump",
      "source_hash": 1787813236821011192,
      "context_hash": 16361123218334288027,
      "translation": "Wireshark / tcpdump",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:38:55.989719Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "For packet-level capture:",
      "source_hash": 16451093161004589383,
      "context_hash": 11951185943090158611,
      "translation": "패킷 수준 캡처의 경우:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:38:55.989719Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "AF_PACKET sockets (what tcpdump uses)",
      "source_hash": 14859745608735263774,
      "context_hash": 594808268270716030,
      "translation": "AF_PACKET 소켓(tcpdump가 사용하는 방식)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:38:55.989720Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "tcpdump uses AF_PACKET sockets, which receive a copy of every packet at the `__netif_receive_skb` level — before the packet is processed by the network stack.",
      "source_hash": 15270546443185689708,
      "context_hash": 2166720095457337002,
      "translation": "tcpdump는 AF_PACKET 소켓을 사용하며, 이 소켓은 패킷이 네트워크 스택에서 처리되기 전인 `__netif_receive_skb` 수준에서 모든 패킷의 사본을 받습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "network stack": "네트워크 스택"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:38:55.989720Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "This is why tcpdump sees packets even if they're subsequently dropped by iptables.",
      "source_hash": 5323294709882020316,
      "context_hash": 15637716586115245129,
      "translation": "이 때문에 tcpdump는 이후 iptables에 의해 드롭되는 패킷도 볼 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:38:55.989720Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Tracing with nftables/iptables",
      "source_hash": 15596906672366088299,
      "context_hash": 9328728452427858824,
      "translation": "nftables/iptables를 이용한 트레이싱",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "tracing": "트레이싱"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:31:09.587635Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "For packet-level debugging of firewall rules:",
      "source_hash": 16346234354123898240,
      "context_hash": 8712740148277261824,
      "translation": "방화벽 규칙의 패킷 수준 디버깅의 경우:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:38:55.989720Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "net_ratelimit and kernel log drops",
      "source_hash": 13739401130505342960,
      "context_hash": 6586013727490934622,
      "translation": "net_ratelimit와 커널 로그 드롭",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:38:55.989720Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The kernel rate-limits some network messages to prevent log flooding.",
      "source_hash": 6055351266073841390,
      "context_hash": 12821189682099794491,
      "translation": "커널은 로그 폭주를 방지하기 위해 일부 네트워크 메시지의 발생 빈도를 제한합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:38:55.989721Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "If you see messages like `net_ratelimit: X callbacks suppressed`, the kernel is dropping log messages:",
      "source_hash": 16611991426719981185,
      "context_hash": 14879247821672006636,
      "translation": "`net_ratelimit: X callbacks suppressed`와 같은 메시지가 보인다면 커널이 로그 메시지를 버리고 있는 것입니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:38:55.989721Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Systematic approach to network debugging",
      "source_hash": 6914991749109922698,
      "context_hash": 5022016201668084791,
      "translation": "네트워크 디버깅을 위한 체계적 접근법",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:38:55.989721Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "**Check counters first**: `/proc/net/dev`, `ethtool -S eth0`, `/proc/net/snmp`",
      "source_hash": 4424889484951164004,
      "context_hash": 7591984849985250086,
      "translation": "**먼저 카운터 확인**: `/proc/net/dev`, `ethtool -S eth0`, `/proc/net/snmp`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:38:55.989721Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "**Identify drop location**: `skb:kfree_skb` tracepoint or `dropwatch`",
      "source_hash": 12454228514840877744,
      "context_hash": 10042639555261392467,
      "translation": "**드롭 위치 식별**: `skb:kfree_skb` 트레이스포인트 또는 `dropwatch`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "tracepoint": "트레이스포인트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:38:55.989721Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "**Check socket queues**: `ss -tn | awk '$2>0 || $3>0'`",
      "source_hash": 1029055611068021287,
      "context_hash": 17398008038785501861,
      "translation": "**소켓 큐 확인**: `ss -tn | awk '$2>0 || $3>0'`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "queues": "큐"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:38:55.989721Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "**Check conntrack**: `conntrack -S`, `cat /proc/sys/net/netfilter/nf_conntrack_count`",
      "source_hash": 13366480502083593975,
      "context_hash": 16855506641210936012,
      "translation": "**conntrack 확인**: `conntrack -S`, `cat /proc/sys/net/netfilter/nf_conntrack_count`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "conntrack": "conntrack"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:38:55.989721Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "**Packet capture**: `tcpdump` for protocol-level analysis",
      "source_hash": 257971616600314683,
      "context_hash": 18199010884210592435,
      "translation": "**패킷 캡처**: 프로토콜 수준 분석을 위한 `tcpdump`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "analysis": "분석"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:38:55.989722Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "**Firewall trace**: nftables `meta nftrace` or iptables LOG",
      "source_hash": 1185354805325443485,
      "context_hash": 830052651730575638,
      "translation": "**방화벽 추적**: nftables `meta nftrace` 또는 iptables LOG",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:38:55.989722Z",
      "issues": []
    },
